oth X Gaming Keyboard Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(17)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1332/202504231153453800153.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"4 out of 5\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Can Buy or Not\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>4 out of 5</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The typing experience is excellent. Keys feel firm when pressed without any wobble, but are smooth and responsive at the same time. I think I made fewer typos compared with keyboards with other linear switches. And for those who are into the typing sound, the ROG Azoth X sounds great to me, without being too noisy.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SINGAPORE</span> <span>06/27/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth X Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of 4 out of 5\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.canbuyornot.com/reviews/asus-rog-azoth-x-review-price/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202511281739588510425.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Game7days 90%\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Game7days.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Game7days 90%</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      High-quality 75 per cent keyboard with a custom keyboard feel that leaves almost nothing to be desired in terms of workmanship, comfort and features.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>11/17/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth X Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Game7days 90%\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://game7days.de/2025/11/17/asus-azoth-x-test-review-pc/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202510312356119970925.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Hardwarezoom: Purchase recommendation 92%\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Hardwarezoom\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Hardwarezoom: Purchase recommendation 92%</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      With the ROG Azoth X, ASUS delivers an all-round successful upgrade to its popular premium keyboard.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>10/23/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth X Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Hardwarezoom: Purchase recommendation 92%\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwarezoom.net/artikel/ASUS_ROG_Azoth_X_Test_Review-59030\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202511010000293400620.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Play experience: Outstanding\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Play Experience\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Play experience: Outstanding</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Azoth X is not just a gaming keyboard. It is an experience, a tool, a statement.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>09/04/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth X Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Play experience: Outstanding\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://play-experience.com/test-asus-rog-azoth-x-premium-gaming-keyboard-mit-show-faktor/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202508222347088040541.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      basic-tutorials.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Azoth X is an impressive custom keyboard across the board, combining extensive customizability with the advantages of a major manufacturer's ecosystem.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>08/22/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth X Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://basic-tutorials.de/tests/technik-gadgets/asus-rog-azoth-x-test/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202507051602332420215.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommendation\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hardwareinside.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommendation</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The special design and high-quality build quality speak for themselves. But so does the option to change the keycaps and switches. Other impressive features include the long battery life, the built-in switches, and the various connection options. The OLED display also offers many useful functions, although whether these are necessary is open to question.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>07/05/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth X Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Recommendation\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwareinside.de/asus-rog-azoth-x-tastatur-im-test-93344\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div cl